#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:2
msgid "Complete local stack"
msgstr "完整的本地环境"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:4
msgid ""
"Run the browser, control plane, runner and real Agent CLIs together on "
"one machine, without production accounts or credentials. The stack has "
"the web app behind a same-origin proxy, the account system, Postgres, "
"host enrollment, the sandbox manager, the sandbox image with pinned "
"Claude Code, Codex, Pi, OpenCode and Kilo CLIs, and a read-only "
"`local/demo` Git repository on the private control-plane network."
msgstr ""
"在一台机器上同时运行浏览器、控制平面、runner 和真实的 Agent CLI，不需要生产环境的账号或凭据。这套环境包括：同源代理后面的 Web"
" 应用、账号系统、Postgres、主机注册、sandbox manager、固定了 Claude Code、Codex、Pi、OpenCode "
"和 Kilo CLI 版本的沙箱镜像，以及控制平面私有网络上的只读 `local/demo` Git 仓库。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:11
msgid ""
"Accounts work as in production, and turns run on a model connection the "
"account adds with its own provider key; the stack ships no model. "
"Sandboxes reach public addresses only, so the provider must be public. "
"Isolation is plain Docker, for trusted development; public multi-tenant "
"deployments need Kata."
msgstr ""
"账号的工作方式与生产环境相同，轮次运行在账号用自己的服务商密钥添加的模型连接上；这套环境不自带模型。沙箱只能访问公网地址，所以服务商必须是公开的。隔离使用普通"
" Docker，只适合可信的开发；公开多租户部署需要 Kata。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:17
msgid "Run"
msgstr "运行"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:19
msgid ""
"From the repository root, with Docker 28 or newer (for the route priority"
" used on sandbox networks) and Compose, `openssl`, `curl` and Python 3:"
msgstr ""
"在仓库根目录运行，需要 Docker 28 或更新版本（沙箱网络要用到路由优先级）以及 Compose、`openssl`、`curl` 和 "
"Python 3："

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:27
msgid ""
"Give Docker Desktop at least 4 GiB of memory, 8 GiB when running turns; "
"about 2 GiB can run out while Kilo starts. The first `up` builds every "
"image, which is slow, then migrates, starts the services and waits for "
"readiness."
msgstr ""
"给 Docker Desktop 至少 4 GiB 内存，运行轮次时给 8 GiB；约 2 GiB 时启动 Kilo 可能耗尽内存。第一次 "
"`up` 会构建所有镜像，比较慢，然后执行迁移、启动服务并等待就绪。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:31
msgid ""
"Open <http://127.0.0.1:13002/setup/administrator> and create the first "
"administrator with the one-time code from `./deploy/local/dev.sh logs "
"control-plane`. It signs in with a login name and needs no mail server. "
"Email sign-up stays closed until you set an email transport, or turn off "
"email verification, under Admin → Settings → Accounts."
msgstr ""
"打开 <http://127.0.0.1:13002/setup/administrator>，用 `./deploy/local/dev.sh "
"logs control-plane` 中的一次性设置码创建第一个管理员。它用登录名登录，不需要邮件服务器。在 Admin → Settings "
"→ Accounts 中配置邮件发送方式或关闭邮箱验证之前，邮箱注册保持关闭。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:37
msgid ""
"`dev.sh` generates local credentials in the git-ignored "
"`deploy/local/.env.local` (mode `0600`). Keep it with the Postgres "
"volume: if the file is missing while the volume exists, the script "
"refuses to generate new credentials, and you must restore the original, "
"especially `AGENT_POSTGRES_PASSWORD` and `AGENT_DATABASE_URL`."
msgstr ""
"`dev.sh` 在被 git 忽略的 `deploy/local/.env.local` 中生成本地凭据（权限 `0600`）。请把它和 "
"Postgres 卷放在一起保管：如果卷还在而文件丢了，脚本会拒绝生成新凭据，你必须恢复原来的文件，尤其是 "
"`AGENT_POSTGRES_PASSWORD` 和 `AGENT_DATABASE_URL`。"

