#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:54
msgid ""
"`LOCAL_EDGE_PORT`, in `.env.local` or exported, changes the browser port."
" For a second checkout on the same Docker engine, give it different "
"values for all of these, and use them on every `dev.sh` call:"
msgstr ""
"在 `.env.local` 中设置或导出 `LOCAL_EDGE_PORT` 可以修改浏览器端口。同一个 Docker "
"引擎上的第二份仓库副本，需要为下列所有项设置不同的值，并在每次调用 `dev.sh` 时使用："

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:58
msgid ""
"`LOCAL_PROJECT_NAME`, `LOCAL_SANDBOX_IMAGE`, `AGENT_NETWORK_NAME` and "
"`LOCAL_RELAY_NETWORK`;"
msgstr ""
"`LOCAL_PROJECT_NAME`、`LOCAL_SANDBOX_IMAGE`、`AGENT_NETWORK_NAME` 和 "
"`LOCAL_RELAY_NETWORK`；"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:60
msgid "`LOCAL_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL`, not overlapping the first stack's pool;"
msgstr "`LOCAL_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL`，不能与第一套环境的地址池重叠；"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:61
msgid ""
"`LOCAL_EDGE_PORT`, `AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_PORT`, `AGENT_MCP_RELAY_PORT` and"
" `AGENT_WEB_PORT`."
msgstr ""
"`LOCAL_EDGE_PORT`、`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_PORT`、`AGENT_MCP_RELAY_PORT` 和 "
"`AGENT_WEB_PORT`。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:64
msgid ""
"An existing `.env.local` names its sandbox image tag explicitly, so "
"change it when you change the project name. `up`, `start` and `smoke` "
"refuse networks another Compose project owns, and the host rules refuse "
"overlapping pools; do not accept Compose's network warning, or traffic "
"can reach the wrong stack."
msgstr ""
"已有的 `.env.local` 明确写有沙箱镜像标签，所以修改项目名时也要改它。`up`、`start` 和 `smoke` 会拒绝属于其他 "
"Compose 项目的网络，主机规则也会拒绝重叠的地址池；不要接受 Compose 的网络警告，否则流量可能进入错误的环境。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:69
msgid "Sandbox networking"
msgstr "沙箱网络"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:71
msgid ""
"Each retained sandbox group gets its own routable `freeinference-chat-"
"net-*` bridge, and the runner or sandbox manager installs and verifies "
"this stack's nftables rules before a sandbox joins it. The rules allow "
"public IPv4 on TCP 80/443, DNS to `LOCAL_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` on TCP/UDP "
"53, and the group's MCP relay port. They block the engine's own "
"addresses, private and special-purpose ranges, other groups, other ports "
"and IPv6, as in production. On first setup, `dev.sh` records a non-"
"loopback IPv4 resolver from the Docker engine (Colima's `192.168.5.1`, "
"for example), or `1.1.1.1`; change `LOCAL_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` if it does "
"not work for you."
msgstr ""
"每个保留沙箱组都有自己可路由的 `freeinference-chat-net-*` 网桥；沙箱加入之前，runner 或 sandbox "
"manager 会安装并校验这套环境的 nftables 规则。规则允许 TCP 80/443 上的公网 IPv4、发往 "
"`LOCAL_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` 的 TCP/UDP 53 端口 DNS，以及本组的 MCP "
"中继端口。规则阻止引擎自身的地址、私有和特殊用途地址段、其他组、其他端口以及 IPv6，与生产环境相同。首次配置时，`dev.sh` 会记录 "
"Docker 引擎提供的非回环 IPv4 解析器（例如 Colima 的 `192.168.5.1`），找不到时用 "
"`1.1.1.1`；如果它对你不可用，请修改 `LOCAL_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER`。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:81
msgid "Building through a proxy"
msgstr "通过代理构建"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:83
msgid ""
"On Docker Desktop, builds can reach a proxy on the host through "
"`host.docker.internal`. Prebuild with Docker's proxy arguments, then "
"start without building, using the same overrides for both commands:"
msgstr ""
"在 Docker Desktop 上，构建可以通过 `host.docker.internal` 访问宿主机上的代理。先用 Docker "
"的代理参数预先构建，再以不构建的方式启动，两条命令使用相同的覆盖项："

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:95
msgid ""
"Re-run `build` after code changes. The proxy applies to build downloads "
"only, not to sandboxes, and certificate and signature checks stay on. "
"Python downloads allow 120 seconds of inactivity; raise "
"`PIP_DEFAULT_TIMEOUT` and the runner's `UV_HTTP_TIMEOUT` build arguments "
"on slow links. If a Debian mirror fails, pass `--build-arg "
"DEBIAN_MIRROR=http://mirrors.aliyun.com` (default "
"`http://deb.debian.org`); it changes only the mirror URLs, not the signed"
" keyring."
msgstr ""
"代码变更后要重新运行 `build`。代理只用于构建时的下载，不用于沙箱，证书和签名检查保持开启。Python 下载允许 120 "
"秒无数据；网络慢时调大 `PIP_DEFAULT_TIMEOUT` 和 runner 的 `UV_HTTP_TIMEOUT` "
"构建参数。Debian 镜像源出错时，传入 `--build-arg "
"DEBIAN_MIRROR=http://mirrors.aliyun.com`（默认 "
"`http://deb.debian.org`）；它只改变镜像源地址，不改变签名密钥环。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:103
msgid "What the smoke test covers"
msgstr "冒烟测试测了什么"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:105
msgid ""
"`smoke` runs first-run setup with the code from the control plane's log, "
"checks the session cookie and an administrator reading settings, checks "
"that the configuration reports `model_connection_required` and that a "
"turn without a connection gets 409, and signs out. On a stack that "
"already has an administrator it accepts `setup_complete` instead, and it "
"fails while setup is pending but the log shows no code."
msgstr ""
"`smoke` 用控制平面日志中的设置码完成首次设置，检查会话 cookie 和管理员读取设置，检查配置报告 "
"`model_connection_required`、没有连接的轮次得到 409，最后退出登录。在已有管理员的环境中，它改为接受 "
"`setup_complete`；如果设置仍待完成但日志中没有设置码，它会失败。"

#: ../../deploy/local/README.md:112
msgid ""
"It runs no turn: the stack has no model. To exercise the CLIs, add a "
"model connection for a public provider in the browser and start a task. "
"The runner takes two concurrent turns by default (`LOCAL_HOST_SLOTS`, at "
"least 2 for concurrent forks; the Servers page can change it live). The "
"local idle timeout is 15 seconds instead of production's 1800, and it "
"never stops an active turn."
msgstr ""
"它不运行任何轮次：这套环境没有模型。要试用 CLI，请在浏览器中为一个公开服务商添加模型连接并启动任务。runner "
"默认同时运行两个轮次（`LOCAL_HOST_SLOTS`，并发 fork 至少需要 2；Servers 页面可以在运行时修改）。本地空闲超时为 "
"15 秒，而生产环境为 1800 秒，并且它从不停止正在运行的轮次。"

